#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/preface/_index.adoc:1
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Preface on assistive technologies available on FreeBSD"
msgstr "FreeBSD 上提供的辅助技术简介"

#. type: Title =
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/preface/_index.adoc:1
